    "language": "swh",
    "review_level": "None",
    "content": "<p>Yesu aliwakera viongozi wa Kiyahudi na wafuasi wao mara kwa mara. Ingawa alitoka katika ukoo wa Mfalme Daudi, walitilia shaka sifa ya mama yake (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt1:18-Matt1:25\">Mathayo 1:18–25</a>). Yesu alitoka Nazareti (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt2:23\">Mathayo 2:23</a>), mahali ambapo pia hapakuwa na sifa nzuri (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt13:53-Matt13:58\">Mathayo 13:53–58</a>). Alifanya kazi hasa Galilaya, mbali na kituo cha mamlaka ya Kiyahudi (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt4:12-Matt4:16\">Mathayo 4:12–16</a>). Rafiki yake wa karibu alikuwa Yohana, ambaye alijulikana kwa kubatiza watu na kuzungumza kwa ujasiri dhidi ya viongozi wa kisiasa kama nabii (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt11:2-Matt11:19\">Mathayo 11:2–19</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt14:3-Matt14:12\">14:3–12</a>).</p><p>Yesu mara nyingi alitoa majibu yasiyo ya moja kwa moja (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt13:10-Matt13:15\">Mathayo 13:10–15</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt17:24-Matt17:27\">17:24–27</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt19:3-Matt19:12\">19:3–12</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt21:23-Matt21:27\">21:23–27</a>). Alikataa kuonyesha ishara za miujiza ili kuthibitisha madai yake (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt12:38-Matt12:42\">12:38–42</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt16:1-Matt16:4\">16:1–4</a>). Alitumia muda na watu ambao jamii ilikuwa imewakataa (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt9:9-Matt9:13\">9:9–13</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt11:16-Matt11:19\">11:16–19</a>). Alipinga desturi za Kiyahudi (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt5:17-Matt5:20\">5:17–20</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt9:14-Matt9:17\">9:14–17</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt12:1-Matt12:14\">12:1–14</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt15:1-Matt15:20\">15:1–20</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt21:12-Matt21:13\">21:12–13</a>). Aliepuka kutambuliwa hadharani (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt8:4\">8:4</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt12:15-Matt12:21\">12:15–21</a>).</p><p>Alishiriki maarifa yake na watu ambao hawakutarajiwa (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt11:25-Matt11:27\">Mathayo 11:25–27</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt13:16-Matt13:17\">13:16–17</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt16:13-Matt16:20\">16:13–20</a>). Alizungumza kuhusu kifo cha aibu ambacho angekumbana nacho (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt16:21\">16:21</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt17:22-Matt17:23\">17:22–23</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt20:18-Matt20:19\">20:18–19</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt26:2\">26:2</a>). Yesu hakutafuta umakini au kufanya jukumu lake liwe wazi. Badala yake, alichagua unyenyekevu, faragha, na kushiriki ufunuo ambao watu wangeweza kuelewa tu kupitia imani.</p><p>Mwishowe, Yesu alithibitishwa kuwa sahihi. Alishinda mabishano (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Luke20:20-Luke20:40\">Luka 20:20–40</a>). Aliondoa pepo waliokuwa wakidhibiti watu (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt8:28-Matt8:34\">Mathayo 8:28–34</a>). Aliponya watu kwa njia za kushangaza (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt9:1-Matt9:8\">Mathayo 9:1–8</a>). Aliwafufua watu kutoka kwa wafu (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt9:18-Matt9:26\">Mathayo 9:18–26</a>). Hatimaye, alifufuka kutoka kwa wafu (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt28:1-Matt28:10\">Mathayo 28:1–10</a>). Huduma yake ilisababisha mgawanyiko lakini ilikuwa na ufanisi katika kuanzisha Ufalme wa Mungu duniani (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt11:2-Matt11:6\">Mathayo 11:2–6</a>).</p><p><u>Sehemu za Kujifunza Zaidi</u></p><p><a href=\"https://ref.ly/Isa3:8\">Isaya 3:8</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Isa8:14-Isa8:15\">8:14–15</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Isa28:12-Isa28:13\">28:12–13</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Isa59:9-Isa59:10\">59:9–10</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Jer13:16\">Yeremia 13:16</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Jer20:11\">20:11</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Jer31:7-Jer31:9\">31:7–9</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Jer50:31-Jer50:32\">50:31–32</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Hos4:4-Hos4:6\">Hosea 4:4–6</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Hos5:5\">5:5</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Hos14:9\">14:9</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Mal2:7-Mal2:9\">Malaki 2:7–9</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt11:5-Matt11:6\">Mathayo 11:5–6</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt13:54-Matt13:58\">13:54–58</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt17:27\">17:27</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt21:42-Matt21:46\">21:42–46</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Mark6:3\">Marko 6:3</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Luke20:17-Luke20:19\">Luka 20:17–19</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/John6:60-John6:69\">Yohana 6:60–69</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Rom9:30-Rom9:33\">Warumi 9:30–33</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Rom11:7-Rom11:12\">11:7–12</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Rom14:12-Rom14:13\">14:12–13</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Rom14:20-Rom14:21\">20–21</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/1Cor1:21-1Cor1:23\">1 Wakorintho 1:21–23</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/1Cor8:9-1Cor8:13\">8:9–13</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/1Cor10:31-1Cor11:1\">10:31–11:1</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/2Cor6:3\">2 Wakorintho 6:3</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gal5:11\">Wagalatia 5:11</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/1Pet2:5-1Pet2:8\">1 Petro 2:5–8</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/1John2:10\">1 Yohana 2:10</a></p>",
